# Vercel build environment (configure in dashboard; Angular does not read .env):
# Exact HTTPS origin, without /api/v1 or trailing slash. This is public routing data.
RENDER_API_ORIGIN=https://<your-render-service-host>
# Frontend production API remains /api/v1. Never put backend secrets here.
# Local npm start still uses src/environments/environment.development.ts.
